@startuml
title 智能阅读器需求模型 V0.3｜用例图·检索与 AI 问答
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #EAF3F8
  BorderColor #1F4E78
  ArrowColor #1F4E78
}
actor "阅读者\nReader" as Reader
actor "工作区所有者" as Owner
actor "云端模型服务" as Model
rectangle "智能阅读器｜检索与问答" {
  usecase "全文/语义/模糊检索" as UC05
  usecase "对文档或选中文本提问" as UC06
  usecase "生成摘要/要点" as UC07
  usecase "核验回答引用" as UC08
  usecase "确认本次外发文件" as UploadConfirm
  usecase "执行权限与证据门控" as Gate
  usecase "执行引用校验" as Cite
  usecase "原文/检索/人工复核降级" as Fallback
}
Reader --> UC05
Reader --> UC06
Reader --> UC07
Reader --> UC08
Owner --> Gate
Model --> UC06
Model --> UC07
UC06 ..> Gate : <<include>>
UC07 ..> Gate : <<include>>
UC06 ..> Cite : <<include>>
UC07 ..> Cite : <<include>>
UC06 ..> UploadConfirm : <<include>>
UC07 ..> UploadConfirm : <<include>>
UC06 ..> Fallback : <<extend>>
UC07 ..> Fallback : <<extend>>
UC08 ..> UC06 : <<extend>>
UC08 ..> UC07 : <<extend>>
note right of Gate
  先做权限过滤，再判断
  证据契约和外发许可。
end note
legend right
  覆盖：FR-03 至 FR-06、FR-09
  规则：BR01 至 BR05、BR08、BR12、BR13
endlegend
@enduml
